<title>UZBEKISTAN: Uzbek Q1 gross domestic product rises 1.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Uzbek Q1 gross domestic product rises 1.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan's gross domestic product was 1.7 percent higher in January-March of this year than in the same period last year, the macroeconomics and statistics ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>    UZBEK GDP		    Jan-Mar '97	     Jan-Mar '96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change     +1.7			-0.4</p>
<p>--Tashkent Newsroom, +7 3712 361958</p>
</text>
